== Effects ==
* Rerolls all items in the room.

== Notes ==
* For further interaction and notes regarding item rerolls, see {{i|The D6}}.

== Strategy ==
* If obtained later in the run, it is recommended to keep it for the {{s|Chest}} / {{s|Dark Room}}, as their first rooms always contain 4 chests whose items can be all rerolled at once.

== Synergies ==
* {{I|Tarot Cloth|nr}}: Instantly re-rolls items twice, essentially removing an extra item from the item pool.

== Interactions ==
* {{I|Tarot Cloth|r}}: No effect.

